      "title": "Hunter Biden talks about how his father’s cancer has spread and is causing him pain",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/aug/08/joe-biden-hunter-cancer",
      "description": "<p>Joe Biden’s prostate cancer is reportedly ‘debilitating’, even as ex-president continues to speak out on public issues</p><p>Former US president <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/joebiden\">Joe Biden</a>’s prostate cancer has spread to other parts of his body and is causing him pain, even as he continues to speak out on public issues, his son <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/hunter-biden\">Hunter</a> said in an interview.</p><p>In a wide-ranging interview with the BBC broadcast late on Friday, Hunter Biden grew emotional as he discussed his father’s condition, describing it as very sad to watch.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/aug/08/joe-biden-hunter-cancer\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
